# Enterprise AI SQL Agent: Business Knowledge Graph & Semantic Metadata Architecture

Transform the current SQL agent into an **Enterprise AI SQL Agent** equipped with a **Business Knowledge Graph**, **Automated Database Profiler**, **Business Metadata Layer**, and **Semantic Term Mapper**. 

The end user interacts purely in natural business terms (e.g. *"Retailer scan count in January 2026"* or *"Show pending withdrawals"*), while the agent automatically resolves business concepts to physical tables, columns, integer role codes, enum values, and foreign key join paths without requiring the user to know anything about the database.

---

## 🏛️ Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TD
    A["User Business Query (Natural Language)"] --> B["Knowledge Graph Semantic Resolver (O(1) In-Memory)"]
    B --> C["Discovered Metadata & DB Profiler (Enums, Status Codes, Role Mappings)"]
    B --> D["Relationship Graph (Foreign Keys & Join Paths)"]
    C --> E["Business Reasoning Context Engine"]
    D --> E
    E --> F["Ultra-Compressed Semantic Prompt (< 250 tokens)"]
    F --> G["Local Qwen2.5-Coder Generation / Direct Execution"]
    G --> H["SQL Validation & Optimization (sqlglot)"]
    H --> I["MySQL Read-Only Database Execution"]
    I --> J["Response Payload + Business Reasoning Steps UI"]
```

